The required operator is denoted $M^\dagger$, the Hermitian conjugate of $M$, and is defined by $M\ket{A}=\ket{B}
\quad\Longleftrightarrow\quad
\bra{A}M^\dagger=\bra{B}.$ The dagger is the operator analogue of complex conjugation.

