Its matrix rule follows directly. Let $M\ket{i}=\ket{i'}.$ Then $m_{ji}=\bra{j}M\ket{i}=\braket{j}{i'}.$ The daggered bra relation is $\bra{i}M^\dagger=\bra{i'}$, so $(m^\dagger)_{ij}
=\bra{i}M^\dagger\ket{j}
=\braket{i'}{j}.$ Reversing an inner product complex conjugates it: $\braket{i'}{j}=\braket{j}{i'}^*.$ Therefore $\boxed{(m^\dagger)_{ij}=m_{ji}^*.}$

